  "content": "\n\n<h1><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/slashblade-resharped\" rel=\"nofollow\">SLASHBLADE: RESHARPED</a> 版本 1.1.5 已修復此問題。請勿使用此修補程式。</h1>\n<hr>\n<p>本模組修復了 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/slashblade-resharped\" rel=\"nofollow\">SlashBlade: Resharped</a> 中的刀刃渲染問題。（<a href=\"https://github.com/0999312/SlashBlade_Resharped/issues/18\" rel=\"nofollow\">#18</a>）</p>\n<p>修復後：\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c24619fb5f3f3bcf273daa1e431e804ace95e761.png\" alt=\"修復後：\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/05e1330873fe9770141bef5308e157edf3564775.png\" alt=\"修復後：\">\n修復前：\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/319a6593d0ddaffdd21e2e45378607e039314474.png\" alt=\"修復前：\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9e3f60f792865ae3599dc9def664f554bd8f7ed0.png\" alt=\"修復前：\"></p>",
